{"signature": "{\"text\": \"Kinetic energy is the energy stored by an object because it is moving. The equation is kinetic energy equals one half multiplied by mass multiplied by speed squared. In symbols, E sub k equals one half m v squared. The mass must be in kilograms, the speed in metres per second and the energy in joules. In this equation, v represents speed, although you may hear it called velocity in some explanations.\", \"voice\": \"en-NG-AbeoNeural\", \"rate\": \"-4%\", \"eleven\": true}", "duration": 26.148571, "words": [["Kinetic", 0.0], ["energy", 0.534], ["is", 0.964], ["the", 1.126], ["energy", 1.277], ["stored", 1.707], ["by", 2.113], ["an", 2.287], ["object", 2.415], ["because", 2.81], ["it", 3.181], ["is", 3.32], ["moving.", 3.495], ["The", 4.005], ["equation", 4.18], ["is", 4.714], ["kinetic", 4.865], ["energy", 5.329], ["equals", 5.77], ["one", 6.258], ["half", 6.49], ["multiplied", 6.838], ["by", 7.477], ["mass", 7.709], ["multiplied", 8.348], ["by", 8.975], ["speed", 9.172], ["squared.", 9.555], ["In", 10.182], ["symbols,", 10.437], ["E", 11.053], ["sub", 11.378], ["k", 11.714], ["equals", 12.074], ["one", 12.632], ["half", 12.875], ["m", 13.293], ["v", 13.537], ["squared.", 13.827], ["The", 14.327], ["mass", 14.512], ["must", 14.826], ["be", 15.058], ["in", 15.209], ["kilograms,", 15.372], ["the", 16.196], ["speed", 16.359], ["in", 16.788], ["metres", 16.962], ["per", 17.415], ["second", 17.612], ["and", 18.1], ["the", 18.286], ["energy", 18.437], ["in", 18.866], ["joules.", 19.006], ["In", 19.691], ["this", 19.888], ["equation,", 20.109], ["v", 20.759], ["represents", 21.119], ["speed,", 21.769], ["although", 22.303], ["you", 22.779], ["may", 22.918], ["hear", 23.116], ["it", 23.348], ["called", 23.499], ["velocity", 23.789], ["in", 24.497], ["some", 24.683], ["explanations.", 24.985]], "raw": [{"text": "Kinetic", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.464}, {"text": "energy", "start": 0.534, "end": 0.906}, {"text": "is", "start": 0.964, "end": 1.068}, {"t